OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid Cymru 'stalling' on
OL,4,Ainvestment in Wales, claims Welsh
OL,5,ASecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Welsh Secretary has accused Wales'
OL,8,FPlaid Cymru government of holding up
OL,9,Finvestment and called for it to work
OL,10,Fmore closely with UK ministers.
OL,12,FSpeaking at Labour's autumn conference
OL,13,Fin Liverpool on Sunday, Stephen Kinnock
OL,14,Fsaid Plaid Cymru was "stalling" on
OL,15,Fdeals resulting in "jobs and security
OL,16,Fdelayed".
OL,18,FHe said he wanted to "reach out" to
OL,19,FPlaid Cymru because, in England, deals
OL,20,Fwere already underway.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
