OL,3,GNEWSAPlaid Cymru 'stalling' on
OL,4,Ainvestment in Wales, claims Welsh
OL,5,ASecretary
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiz Saville Roberts MP, Plaid Cymru
OL,8,Fgroup leader in Westminster, said
OL,9,FKinnock should "reflect on why so many
OL,10,Fpeople chose positive change after 27
OL,11,Fyears of Welsh Labour rule" instead of
OL,12,F"throwing insults".
